{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f36b5df8-653d-8b58-9b79-f10dd18b8d3d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T15:03:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisa Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:00:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Happy almost New Year, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, before anything else, could I get your name again? Denise, and last name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:00:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Denise Arruda. A-R-R-U-D-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:00:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Denise Arruda, got it. Sorry, I'm walking down a hallway and my footsteps are echoing, so if I break up, that's why. [line breaks up] Can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:00:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you, a little echo-y but fine. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:01:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm Marisa Varela. I'm at 1 Broadway, in the North End. The catch basin on the corner is completely full of sand. I think it's from the winter road treatment. And since last Thursday the street just holds water there. It hasn't rained, it's dry out, and the water just sits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:01:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since last Thursday, and no rain in between. So it's a drainage problem, the basin's clogged up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:01:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And I'm not the first to notice. A neighbor told me it happens every big rain, that it never drains right. So it's been like this a while, and now it's just sitting there with no storm at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:01:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sand gets packed into those basins and they stop taking water. Let me get this down. One Broadway, the basin at the corner, sanded in, standing water since Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:01:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Hold on, let me write that. [inaudible] Okay. Sorry, say the last part again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:02:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Standing water since last Thursday, basin full of sand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So my question is, will a work order be opened? And for what date? I'd like to write down a date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:02:15-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll open the work order right now while we're talking. As for the date, it goes to the crew that handles basin cleaning, and they work through the list by location. I'd say expect it within the week or so, but I'll note that it's standing water so it gets flagged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:02:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Within the week or so. Okay. And that's a work order number I can reference?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:02:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll give you the number once it saves. Can I get a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:02:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:02:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-five. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:02:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And honestly, it's frustrating. If it floods every big rain, somebody should have cleaned that out long before now. I'm not the first to say it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:03:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'm putting in the note that it's a repeat spot, so the crew sees that. Okay, it saved. Your work order number is four-four-one-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:03:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-four-one-seven. Writing it down. [line breaks up] Sorry, was that seventeen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:03:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, four-four, one-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:03:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Okay, thank you, Denise. If it's not done by next Tuesday, I'll call back with that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. Have a good rest of your day."
    }
  ],
